From eeb2ff0db1686eb142ff71f1ab0fdab469f0791f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 05:20:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Security audit: fail-closed encryption, real connection
 status, close WA phone-ID hijack, harden postMessage + signup lifecycle

- backend/utils/crypto.js, server.js: encrypt() now throws instead of
  silently storing plaintext when ENCRYPTION_KEY is missing/invalid;
  server refuses to boot on a malformed key instead of only checking
  presence.
- backend/models/Business.js, metaOAuthController.js: added
  whatsappConnectionStatus (disconnected/activation_pending/connected)
  so a customer is never shown Connected when Meta's required
  post-signup activation (WABA webhook subscription, Cloud API phone
  registration) didn't both succeed. Applied across embedded signup,
  classic OAuth, phone-picker, token-status, and disconnect.
- backend/controllers/businessController.js: removed
  whatsappPhoneNumberId from the general PUT /api/business allowed
  fields. It was previously customer-writable with no ownership
  check and no unique constraint, letting an authenticated customer
  overwrite it with another business's phone_number_id and collide
  with the webhook handler's Business.findOne lookup - a real
  cross-customer message-routing risk.
- frontend/src/pages/Settings.jsx: removed manual WhatsApp Phone
  Number ID / Access Token entry fields; replaced with a read-only
  status view pointing to the guided Connect WhatsApp flow.
- frontend/src/pages/WhatsAppConnect.jsx: replaced the
  endsWith('facebook.com') postMessage origin check with an
  exact-match allowlist plus message-shape validation; replaced the
  fixed 25s Embedded Signup timeout with a listener tied to
  FB.login's popup-close callback (short grace period + 5min safety
  net); added an activation-pending UI state.
- Added backend/tests/{crypto,metaOAuthController,businessController}.test.js
  (51 -> 55 passing tests).
